                <pb facs="1011" n="917" xml:id="pg917"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-11"><hi rendition="#italic">August 11,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Poche telegraphs six Armenian naturalized citizens of the United States in prison
                    at Aleppo clamor for more food. A demand for their delivery required by modus
                    vivendi not answered. I believe they are revolutionists.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
